<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Santos suspends well after oil show.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Santos suspends well after oil show.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santos Ltd said on Wednesday it had suspended the UK Block 22/22c-3 well, located 128 miles east of Aberdeen, Scotland, pending further evaluation of oil shows.  </p>
<p>&quot;The well encountered an oil zone in the Tay sandstone objective. The well was not tested and has been temporarily suspended, pending future evaluation,&quot; Santos said.</p>
<p>Santos owns a 13.34 percent stake in Block 22/22c. Operator Marathon Oil Co owns 53.34 percent, Pan Canadian North Sea Ltd owns 20 percent, Oranje Nassau Petroleum Search BV owns 8.89 percent and Edinburgh Oil and Gas Plc owns 4.44 percent.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
